{"script":"sj_041_03","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1b","noIn":false,"x":280,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-350,"mirrow":false},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1b","noIn":false,"x":280,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-350,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[show]啊，是你呀。呃……其实……[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]我听说驿站有一名同样精通剑术的明星契约者，还在想能不能见到她。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]是的……如果有机会的话，我想跟这种高手过过招。当然，只是切磋战斗技巧。虽然我姑且是个剑客，但剑技也没人教我，是自创的野路子。只有不断经历实战，才能改良和精进。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]为什么这么执着？怎么说呢，大兽潮之后的湖畔，有些太过和平了。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]作为带领负责大市集最强武装力量的队长……整天只能抓捕一些流氓和盗贼，我已经很久没有和强者切磋过了。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]你问之前？我之前那些能整日切磋的伙伴们，都在了大兽潮中牺牲了。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]不，这没有什么好难过的。当灾难到来之时，他们已拼尽全力完成了自己的使命。所有生还下来的住民已对他们进行了哀悼。我也不会忘记他们的牺牲。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]你说你能理解我？如果你也能更强一些，也许我们也能互相切磋？哈哈哈哈。那我来当你的教官，也来训练训练你的剑技吧。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]怎么，这就怕了？只会用锤子战斗又怎么样了，真正的战士都是多面手。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]好啦，不开你玩笑了。但还是谢谢你，{myName}，听我说了这么多。下次有机会的话，一定要找到那个契约者切磋一下。再见啦。[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","noIn":false,"x":280,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-350,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"埃迪蒂-（向有些躁动的埃迪蒂问好。）"}